OL,3,GNEWSABusiness owner woke up to find
OL,4,A'beach huts floating away'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA business owner who woke up to her
OL,7,Fbeach huts being taken out by the tide
OL,8,Famid Storm Boelo has said it was a
OL,9,F"miracle" they stayed in one piece.
OL,11,FKathryn Hodgson has run her business
OL,12,FPort Erin Beach Huts on the Isle of Man
OL,13,Ffor about five years, but said the
OL,14,Fconditions on Saturday evening and in
OL,15,Fthe early hours of Sunday had been
OL,16,F"unusual".
OL,18,FShe said: "I have been hit by storms
OL,19,Fbefore, and I do get some damage but it
OL,20,Fwas like the perfect storm, but
OL,21,Fobviously not for me, or for the huts."
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
