OL,3,GNEWSABusiness owner woke up to find
OL,4,A'beach huts floating away'
OL,5,
OL,6,FDue to the south westerly wind
OL,7,Fdirection, gusts of up to 70mph
OL,8,F(113km/h) and the high tide, she knew
OL,9,Fthe huts were going to be impacted.
